# ttr: dialect=b lang=en
Load objednávky as o.
Keep the rows where částka is more than 10 and částka is less than 500.
Keep the rows where částka is not more than 400 or částka is not less than 20.
Keep the rows where stav is "otevřená" and stav is not "zrušená".
Keep the rows where poznámka is not empty.
Remove the rows where oblast is empty.
Keep the rows where oblast is one of ('S', 'J').
Keep the rows where částka is between 1 and 9.
Keep the rows where částka is bigger than 1 and částka is smaller than 900.
Keep the rows where částka is not bigger than 800 and částka is not smaller than 2.
Keep the rows where stav is equal to "otevřená" or stav is not equal to "x".
Keep the rows where příznak is true or příznak is false.
Summarize sum of částka as celkem, count of číslo as počet_kusů by oblast.
